  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Denmark&apos;s Support to Climate Investment Fund&apos;s Accelerating Coal Transition (ACT) Investment Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the appraisal is to inform and guide the formulation of the Danida support. The appraisal will be undertaken as a desk appraisal in accordance with the Aid Management Guidelines. 

The objective of the appraisal is to provide GDK with an assessment of the draft PD plus annexes. The assessment shall provide specific findings and related recommendations as to adjustments and improvements (as needed) in the final Project Document before submittance to the appropriating Danida authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
